"""Idempotent development seed data.

Only clearly fictional data is created: 15 demo institutions across 5 states,
one account per APH role, and five pre-staged applications that exercise the
full workflow (EoA self-disclosure, new-institution scrutiny deficiency,
LoR with 7-day appeal, LoA with Security Deposit, clean institution Nil Deficiency).

Illustrative document rules, SLA durations, alert rules and compliance rules are
seeded as editable configuration; they are not real AICTE norms or thresholds.
"""

